SUMMARY:The Servant in 4K
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260422
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260423
DTSTAMP:20260329T015426Z
UID:019be23a-cc0f-3911-4f20-36f61f046d2f@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, April 22\, 2026\n\nLocation: Academy Museum of Mot
 ion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 56m\n\n1963 | 116 min. | UK | Black-and-White 
 | English | Not Rated | 4K DCP \nDIRECTED BY: Joseph Losey  \nWRITTEN BY:
  Harold Pinter  \nWITH: Dirk Bogarde\, James Fox\, Sarah Miles\, Wendy Cr
 aig\n\nType: Screenings\n\nDirector Joseph Losey’s first of three collab
 orations with writer Harold Pinter was this adaptation of Robin Maugham’
 s 1948 novella. Focusing on social class and interpersonal relationships\,
  the story follows Barrett (Dirk Bogarde) who is hired as manservant when 
 the wealthy Tony (James Fox) moves into a new house. The two form a bond\,
  but Tony is unaware of Barrett’s ulterior motive to gain the upper hand
  in their relationship. To further his goals\, Barrett convinces Tony to h
 ire a maid and brings his lover (Sara Miles) into the home under the guise
  that they are siblings.
LOCATION:Academy Museum of Motion Pictures
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/calendar/the-servant-in-4-k-019be23a-
 cc0f-3911-4f20-36f61f046d2f
