CATEGORIES:Conversations
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 16\, 2026 at 2pm\n\nLocation: Level 4\n\nCost: 
 Free with general admission\n\nType: Conversations\n\nCostume designer and
  Academy member Isis Mussenden gives a 30-minute tour that pieces together
  the art of costume design in films and the process of creating a characte
 r’s identity. The tour will showcase the way the three leading men in Ja
 ws (1975) highlighted their identity through their distinct costumes. \nSt
 ay for a brief Q&A with Mussenden after the tour.
