 i Kurosawa  \nWITH: Kôji Yakusho\, Masato Hagiwara\, Tsuyoshi Ujiki\, Yu
 kijiro Hotaru\n\nType: Screenings\n\nThis brooding psychological crime thr
 iller introduced writer-director Kiyoshi Kurosawa to an international audi
